# A chapter is published by the owner's approval in its manifest (RFD 2,
# rfd/0002/AUTHORING_FORMAT.adoc). The build checks that an approval's digest
# matches the content, but a digest cannot say who wrote the approval, so every
# change to a manifest needs the owner's review. This file protects itself for
# the same reason.
#
# GitHub enforces this only while the default branch's protection requires a
# review from Code Owners.

/historical/chapters/*.yaml @darwin67
/.github/CODEOWNERS @darwin67
